.ds-review-switch { display: flex; gap: var(--space-1); }

.ds-proposal-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; text-align: left; width: 100%; gap: var(--space-1); margin-top: var(--space-2); padding: var(--space-2); border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); color: var(--text-primary); background: transparent; overflow-wrap: anywhere; cursor: pointer; }
.ds-proposal-row:hover { background: var(--bg-tertiary); }
.ds-proposal-row[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--bg-tertiary); border-color: var(--accent-primary); }
.ds-proposal-row span { color: var(--text-secondary); }
.ds-proposal-row { font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; }

.ds-review-select-label { display: flex; gap: var(--space-1); flex-direction: column; }
.ds-review-select { max-width: 180px; background: var(--bg-secondary); color: var(--text-primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: var(--space-1); font: inherit; }
.ds-review-select-label { font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-primary); }

.ds-evidence-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-1); padding: var(--space-2) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-default); }
.ds-evidence-row span { color: var(--text-secondary); }
.ds-evidence-row summary { cursor: pointer; line-height: 1.6; }
.ds-evidence-row pre { font-size: 11px; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.ds-evidence-row { font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-primary); }

rules.body:
Selection has a visible border and pressed state;
run status and verdicts remain readable text, rather than being encoded only in
color.
